                    <attribute id="Description" value="Adds a Equipment-Set-Backpack. Using the item in the backpack will equip the equippables from the backback and store your current equipment in the backpack. Does not unequip equipment which has no counterpart in the backpack, by default in combat this has 1 turn cooldown and costs 1 AP. If LeaderLib is installed there is a setting to define the MaxAPCosts and a Cooldown if in combat. Requires Script Extender." type="30" />
